t.AbstractDataStore.delete\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Delete data by identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key for the stored data</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Additional operation-specific options</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.encrypt\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">encrypt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state_data</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></a><span class=\"p\"><s